# Pi Sandbox Workflows

Canonical project Brain for `/Users/joel/Code/joelhooks/pi-cloudflare-sandbox-workflows`.

This note was moved from the top-level `joelhooks/.brain/projects/ephemeral-pi-sandboxes.svx` so future design/prototype receipts live with the repo that owns the work.

## Decision

The browser terminal Cloudflare prototype proved that Pi can run in a Cloudflare Sandbox with ChatGPT/Codex subscription OAuth seeded through `~/.pi/agent/auth.json`, but the desired product shape is **contextual sandboxes for bounded runs**, not a persistent browser TUI.

Accepted identity boundary: **context capsule keyed by the external work item/thread**, not by sandbox ID. Sandbox IDs are replaceable compute handles; the capsule owns durable state.

