- Integrated capsule run: `pnpm prototype:integrated:real` wrote ignored receipt `prototypes/integrated-capsule-run-spike/out/latest-receipt.json`; local Durable Object capsule routes by `workItemId`, persists supervisor state/events, calls the deployed real sandbox Worker, and captures real Sandbox/Artifacts/Wzrrd/verification receipts. Latest integrated run: capsule `capsule:thread-or-issue-integrated-50ce77b3`, repo `piwf-run-mpz1z9vz-29d06a92`, plan commit `5177b6b834a0b8580bb10806c9fdc6547b8aa419`, reader commit `a8fd1cf660e2e165a6255e78ed876b76ed8a5aab`, verifier commit `daf3e3d97ee24ac28b5ff3314cf7b5589cfa3bef`, lease ref `lease:piCodexAuth:run-mpz1z9vz-29d06a92:task-scoped-auth-json`, final state `captured`, verification `verified`, destroy receipt `destroy:run-mpz1z9vz-29d06a92:ok`, Wzrrd `https://piwf-run-mpz1z9vz-29d06a92.wzrrd.sh/`, HTTP `200` verified, receipt schema `integrated-capsule-run-receipt.v1`. Limitation: bridge calls deployed `sandbox-workflow-spike` over HTTP; DO + Sandbox/Artifacts bindings are not yet one deployed module.
- Machine planner dry run: `pnpm prototype:planner:dry` wrote ignored receipt `prototypes/machine-planner-spike/out/latest-receipt.json`; planner selects from a known pattern library and emits JSON/config-like XState v5 machine receipts, harness plans, verification contracts, output targets, and policy checks without executing generated TypeScript. Planned fixtures: `thread-report-123 -> reader_verifier + wzrrd_review`, `issue-gh-pr-456 -> edit_verify_pr + github_pr`, `internal-analysis-789 -> artifact_only_capture + artifact_only`. GitHub PR plan has no Wzrrd state names and uses GitHub App/broker/ShitRat actor policy; Wzrrd target is target-specific SvelteKit static HTML + Wzrrd publish delivery; artifact-only has no external publish. Unsafe `requestedMachineCode` / `machineTs` fixture rejected before planning. Receipt schema `machine-planner-receipt.v1`.
- Unauthenticated deployed `GET /healthz` returned `401` after hardening, so a missing `ACCESS_TOKEN` no longer leaves public workers open.
- `prototypes/sandbox-workflow-spike/scripts/wrangler-with-cloudflare-token.mjs` wraps Wrangler and leases Cloudflare credentials from agent-secrets when `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` / `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` are absent; secret names are overrideable with `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN_SECRET_NAME` and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID_SECRET_NAME`.

